      en: ["Philadelphia served as the temporary U.S. capital from 1790 to 1800.", "The city is home to Elfreth's Alley, the nation's oldest continuously inhabited street.", "The Philadelphia Museum of Art is famous for the 'Rocky Steps' from the 1976 film.", "The Declaration of Independence was signed at Independence Hall in 1776.", "The University of Pennsylvania was co-founded by Benjamin Franklin in 1740.", "Philadelphia contains more outdoor murals than any other city in the world."],
