      en: ["Detroit was founded on July 24, 1701, by Antoine de la Mothe Cadillac.", "In 1903, the Ford Motor Company was founded in Detroit.", "Motown Records was founded by Berry Gordy Jr. in Detroit in 1959.", "Detroit was the first U.S. city to have a paved concrete road (Woodward Avenue, 1909).", "The Detroit-Windsor Tunnel was the world's first international vehicle tunnel.", "The city filed for the largest municipal bankruptcy in U.S. history in July 2013."],
      es: ["Fundada en 1701 por colonos franceses", "Centro histórico de la industria automotriz de EE. UU. (Ford, GM, Chrysler)", "Cuna de la historia musical de Motown", "Vive actualmente una renovación urbana del centro", "La arquitectura muestra edificios significativos de estilo art déco", "Ubicación importante para la tecnología de fabricación moderna"],
      pt: ["Fundada em 1701 por colonos franceses", "Centro histórico da indústria automobilística dos EUA (Ford, GM, Chrysler)", "Berço da história da música Motown", "Atualmente vivenciando uma renovação urbana do centro", "A arquitetura mostra edifícios significativos no estilo art déco", "Local importante para a tecnologia de fabricação moderna"],
      fr: ["Fondée en 1701 par des colons français", "Centre historique de l'industrie automobile américaine (Ford, GM, Chrysler)", "Berceau de l'histoire de la musique Motown", "Connaît actuellement un renouveau urbain de son centre-ville", "L'architecture présente des bâtiments Art déco remarquables", "Site majeur pour les techniques de fabrication modernes"],
