      en: ["Portland was founded in 1845.", "Portland's International Rose Test Garden was established in 1917.", "The city has over 600 food carts, creating a diverse culinary culture.", "Portland's urban growth boundary was the first of its kind in the US.", "Powell's City of Books is the world's largest independent bookstore.", "The St. Johns Bridge is the northernmost bridge on the Willamette River in Portland."],
      es: ["Fundación oficial en el año 1851", "Conocida por el 'International Rose Test Garden'", "Líder en el fomento del transporte público", "Centro de sostenibilidad ecológica y urbanización verde", "Vibrante escena local de artesanía, cervecerías y gastronomía", "La ciudad cuenta con una red distintiva de parques y rutas ciclistas"],
      pt: ["Fundação oficial em 1851", "Conhecida pelo 'International Rose Test Garden'", "Pioneira na promoção do transporte público", "Centro de sustentabilidade ecológica e urbanização ecológica", "Cena local vibrante de artesanato, cervejarias e gastronomia", "A cidade possui uma rede distinta de parques e ciclovias"],
      fr: ["Fondation officielle en 1851", "Connue pour l'« International Rose Test Garden »", "Pionnière dans la promotion des transports publics", "Centre de durabilité écologique et d'urbanisation durable", "Scène locale dynamique pour l'artisanat, les brasseries et la gastronomie", "La ville dispose d'un réseau étendu de parcs et de pistes cyclables"],
