      en: ["Raleigh was founded in 1792 to be the new capital of North Carolina.", "The Research Triangle Park was established in 1959.", "North Carolina State University was founded in 1887 and is the largest university in the Carolinas.", "The population of Raleigh surpassed 467,000 in 2020.", "The North Carolina State Capitol, a National Historic Landmark, was completed in 1840.", "The NHL's Carolina Hurricanes team plays at the PNC Arena in Raleigh."],
