      en: ["Riverside was founded in 1870.", "The first two navel orange trees in California were planted in Riverside in 1873.", "The historic Mission Inn Hotel & Spa occupies an entire city block.", "The University of California, Riverside (UCR) was established in 1954.", "The city's population is over 330,000.", "Mount Rubidoux Park is a popular hiking spot offering panoramic city views."],
