      en: ["Lexington was named in 1775 and incorporated in 1782.", "The city is surrounded by over 450 horse farms.", "The University of Kentucky was founded in 1865.", "Lexington is the second-largest city in Kentucky, with over 320,000 residents.", "The first commercial wine operation in the U.S. was established near Lexington in 1799.", "Keeneland racetrack opened in 1936 and is a National Historic Landmark."],
