      en: ["Famous for Buffalo wings", "Industrial heritage", "Albright-Knox Art Gallery", "Snowy winters"],
      es: ["Conocida por las Buffalo Wings", "Patrimonio industrial", "Albright-Knox Art Gallery", "Inviernos con mucha nieve"],
